title: "When does symbolic regression add to tower micrometeorology? Code and results"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "sanxin90-sys"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sanxin90-sys/sr-paper"
abstract: >-
  Code, result tables and figure scripts for an article that tests eight
  equation-discovery engines and the AI-Lorenz pipeline on ten
  micrometeorological laws, two dynamical systems and an audited flux-tower
  record from Rebio Jaru, Rondonia, Brazil.
keywords:
  - symbolic regression
  - equation discovery
  - eddy covariance
  - benchmark
  - model evaluation
